Z||000001||GT Bastard||07-31-2000||03:05 PM||||I talked to the guy that owned the car in pic 47.  He and another Fiero guy met up with some local Fiero nuts from Sioux Falls, SD.  I guess he was on vacation or something.  He was actually the first Fiero person that I didn't like!  Cocky as hell, and his car was an almost stock automatic.  He didn't even want to look at my car or anyone else's for that matter.  Anyhow, wish I coulda gotten off work to be there.||||reg||1
